...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
app: app.py { class: ours }
agent: chat()+Runner (agent.py) { class: ours }
sess: SessionService { class: ours }
gemini: Gemini API { class: ext }

user -> app: 메시지 입력
app -> agent: chat(user_id, message)
agent -> sess: get_session, 없으면 create_session
sess -> agent: Session(state)
agent -> gemini: run_async 모델 요청
gemini -> agent: 키 없으면 예외 (내부에서 처리)
agent -> sess: append_event로 상태 갱신
agent -> app: response_text
app -> user: 화면에 표시
